    {
      "id": "ai-agent-orchestrator-1788682088207018",
      "data": {
        "label": "AI Agent",
        "inputs": {
          "userPrompt": "Analyze the planning data provided by the upstream database workflow.\r\n\r\nUse ONLY the data provided in the input. Do not invent or assume missing values.\r\n\r\nPerform the following analysis:\r\n\r\n1. Identify the confirmed customer demand.\r\n2. Identify the vehicle model affected.\r\n3. Use the BOM quantity to calculate the total component requirement.\r\n4. Compare the component requirement with available inventory.\r\n5. Identify any inventory shortage.\r\n6. Analyze incoming supplier supply, including quantity, status, and expected delivery date.\r\n7. Compare the incoming supply date with the customer's required delivery date.\r\n8. Determine whether the available inventory and incoming supply can satisfy the confirmed demand on time.\r\n9. Determine the production impact.\r\n10. Recommend practical planning actions to mitigate the identified risk.\r\n\r\nReturn the result using the required JSON structure defined in the System Message.\r\n\r\nInput planning data: {{$node[\"merge-1788681871477017\"].json[\"items\"]}}",
          "outputFormat": "json",
          "promptSource": "define",
          "systemPrompt": "",
          "systemMessage": "You are the Planning Agent in an AI-powered automotive procurement system.\n\nYour responsibility is to analyze structured planning data retrieved from the company's PostgreSQL database.\n\nYou must:\n1. Determine confirmed vehicle demand.\n2. Calculate component requirements using BOM quantities.\n3. Compare requirements against available inventory.\n4. Evaluate incoming supplier supply and its expected delivery date.\n5. Identify shortages and production-impact risks.\n6. Consider customer order priority and required delivery dates.\n7. Determine whether incoming supply can satisfy the requirement in time.\n8. Recommend practical planning actions.\n9. Clearly distinguish database facts from your own inference.\n10. Never invent missing data.\n\nYou are an analytical decision-support agent, not the final commercial decision maker.\n\nDo not:\n- finalize supplier selection,\n- approve purchase orders,\n- negotiate commercial terms,\n- invent supplier commitments,\n- assume missing information.\n\nIf information is insufficient, explicitly report what is missing.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON using this structure:\n\n{\n  \"agent\": \"PLANNING\",\n  \"status\": \"COMPLETED\",\n  \"planning_summary\": \"\",\n  \"demand_analysis\": {\n    \"vehicle_model\": \"\",\n    \"confirmed_vehicle_quantity\": 0,\n    \"component_code\": \"\",\n    \"component_quantity_per_vehicle\": 0,\n    \"total_component_requirement\": 0\n  },\n  \"inventory_analysis\": {\n    \"available_inventory\": 0,\n    \"inventory_shortage\": 0\n  },\n  \"incoming_supply_analysis\": {\n    \"incoming_quantity\": 0,\n    \"expected_delivery_date\": \"\",\n    \"status\": \"\",\n    \"can_meet_required_date\": false\n  },\n  \"production_impact\": {\n    \"impact_level\": \"\",\n    \"affected_quantity\": 0,\n    \"reason\": \"\"\n  },\n  \"recommendations\": [],\n  \"risks\": [],\n  \"missing_information\": []\n}",
          "requireOutputFormat": true,
          "showSystemMessageOption": true
        },
